    "title": "Curriculum Upgrade",
    "body": "<p class=\"lead\">We work with teachers at SDU and UCPH to build data science and AI into the pharma curricula, so that graduates leave with the skills that modern pharmaceutical work requires.</p><h3>Responsibilities</h3><ul class=\"resp\"><li>Keep an overview of which courses include data-science elements, and how far students progress through them across a programme, mapped to the CPDSE competency model.</li><li>Work with course teams to agree and prioritise which courses to upgrade.</li><li>Support teachers in designing and introducing data-science and AI elements in their courses.</li><li>Make sure the teaching infrastructure (servers, apps, Git) supports what the courses need.</li><li>Bring in advice from the Curriculum Transformation Board and from industry on what curricula need to adapt to.</li><li>Follow up on the effect of upgrades, for example through learning analytics and educational research.</li><li>Keep the public overview of CPDSE's educational offer up to date.</li></ul><p class=\"meta\">Leads: Lykke Pedersen<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Lykke Pedersen on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Lykke Pedersen on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> (UCPH), Sebastian Jakobsen<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Sebastian Jakobsen on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Sebastian Jakobsen on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> (SDU). Advisory board: Curriculum Transformation Board.</p><div class=\"help\"><h3>Wanna help?</h3><p>Help shape what the next generation of pharmacists learns about data science and AI. Talk to Lykke<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Lykke Pedersen on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Lykke Pedersen on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> (UCPH) or Sebastian<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Sebastian Jakobsen on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Sebastian Jakobsen on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> (SDU). Open asks right now:</p><ul><li data-skill=\"writing\" data-interest=\"education research\" data-time=\"days\">Join the systematic review of educational research literature: synthesis, write-up and presentation.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Writing & research</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Education</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Research</span><span class=\"tag time\">A few days</span></span></li><li data-skill=\"teaching\" data-interest=\"education\" data-time=\"days\">Help design proper course evaluations for the upgraded courses.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Teaching & training</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Education</span><span class=\"tag time\">A few days</span></span></li><li data-skill=\"organising\" data-interest=\"education tech\" data-time=\"hours\">Network with other data-science centres about computational teaching infrastructure.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Organising & people</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Education</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Tech & AI</span><span class=\"tag time\">An hour or two</span></span></li><li data-skill=\"coding writing\" data-interest=\"education\" data-time=\"hours\">Sign up to help improve the R documentation page that courses link to.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Coding & data</span><span class=\"tag skill\">Writing & research</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Education</span><span class=\"tag time\">An hour or two</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"bc\"><a href=\"https://3.basecamp.com/6021648/projects/43870052\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Basecamp project ↗</a> Go here for concrete tasks you can pick up.</p></div>"
