    "title": "Research Project Consulting",
    "body": "<p class=\"lead\">We bring data-science expertise into individual research projects, so that researchers can do analyses, models and visualisations they could not do alone.</p><h3>Responsibilities</h3><ul class=\"resp\"><li>Act as the single point of entry for researchers who need data-science help on a project.</li><li>Assess each request and match it to the right CPDSE expertise.</li><li>Check capacity before accepting new projects.</li><li>Keep an overview of ongoing projects and the people working on them.</li><li>Make sure the work is done to a professional standard and handed over properly to the research group.</li><li>Learn from finished projects to improve the service and identify recurring needs.</li></ul><p class=\"meta\">Lead: Arnault-Quentin Vermillet<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Arnault-Quentin Vermillet on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Arnault-Quentin Vermillet on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> (with Sarah Mittenentzwei<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Sarah Mittenentzwei on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Sarah Mittenentzwei on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span> at SDU later, if needed). Advisory board: Institutional Advisory Board.</p><div class=\"help\"><h3>Wanna help?</h3><p>If you enjoy getting your hands dirty with real research data, this is for you. And if your own project needs a data scientist, this is where to start. Get in touch with Arnault<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Arnault-Quentin Vermillet on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Arnault-Quentin Vermillet on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span>.</p><ul><li data-skill=\"coding\" data-interest=\"research\" data-time=\"days\">Help a research project with an analysis, a model or a visualisation.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Coding & data</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Research</span><span class=\"tag time\">A few days</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"bc\"><a href=\"https://3.basecamp.com/6021648/projects/46868831\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Related Basecamp project ↗</a></p></div>"
