    "title": "Research Group Strategy Consulting",
    "body": "<p class=\"lead\">We help research groups and departments plan how to build their data-science capability, so that they can strengthen their research in a lasting way rather than project by project.</p><h3>Responsibilities</h3><ul class=\"resp\"><li>Engage research groups and departments that want to strengthen their data-science capability.</li><li>Help them assess where they stand and agree on a strategy for where to go: skills, pipelines, infrastructure, hiring.</li><li>Connect the strategy to the other services (People Development, Research Project Consulting) where that makes sense.</li><li>Follow up with groups over time on whether the strategy is working.</li><li>Feed recurring needs back to the Mission circle as input to CPDSE's priorities.</li></ul><p class=\"meta\">Lead: Morten Lindow<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Morten Lindow on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Morten Lindow on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span>. Advisory board: Institutional Advisory Board.</p><div class=\"help\"><h3>Wanna help?</h3><p>Help research groups take the next step with data science, from pipelines to hiring. Interested in joining a strategy conversation, or would your own group like one? Get in touch with Morten<span class=\"bcp\" title=\"Morten Lindow on Basecamp\" aria-label=\"Morten Lindow on Basecamp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M2 15c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6z\"/></svg></span>.</p><ul><li data-skill=\"organising\" data-interest=\"research\" data-time=\"hours\">Join a conversation with a research group about its data-science strategy.<span class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag skill\">Organising & people</span><span class=\"tag interest\">Research</span><span class=\"tag time\">An hour or two</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"bc\"><a href=\"https://3.basecamp.com/6021648/projects/48628172\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Basecamp project ↗</a> Go here for concrete tasks you can pick up.</p></div>"
